# The working directory and the public repo are the same tree. This file is the line
# between them: everything here stays local. Evidence and reference material publish.

# --- Private: Claude's working state, never published ---
# Brandon's pen (`monologues/`) and the developed article substance (`angles/`) both moved
# out of the project on 2026-08-19, to ~/Documents/monologues/. Nothing here needs to
# ignore them any more; they are not in the tree.
memory/
.remember/
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- Machine-generated / rebuildable ---
files/venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Large binaries: too big for git, published elsewhere if at all ---
podcasts/mp3s/

# --- OS noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Site build output (the site's source is tracked; its build is not) ---
web/dist/
web/.astro/
web/node_modules/

# --- Pulled 2026-08-17, pending the AI-disclosure policy update ---
# Not secret; withheld deliberately. These are agent-operating files and
# pre-publication working material, not evidence. Revisit each one when the
# disclosure policy is rewritten and republish what belongs in the open.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
files/ai-toolchain-changelog.md
files/cold-read/

# --- Scratch and editor droppings. These regrow; keep them out for good. ---
